Package: zplexpress
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs (>= 18.0.0), cups, cups-client, xdg-utils
Suggests: ocom-ocbp-t4201-driver (>= 1.0.3)
Maintainer: Louis Nyirongo <louisnyirongo@lukeinternational.no>
Homepage: https://github.com/malawi-ministry-of-health-dhd/zplexpress
Description: ZPL printing service for ARGOX, ZEBRA, and OCOM printers
 A Node.js service that receives ZPL (Zebra Programming Language) over HTTP
 and prints to CUPS. ARGOX and ZEBRA receive raw ZPL, while OCOM OCBP-T4201
 jobs can be rendered locally to exact-size PDF or routed through the
 installed ZPL-to-TSPL translator.
